2026-07-27T12:19:59.0104599Z i /tmp/RtmpEe6dBH/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:19:59.0104965Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:19:59.0105415Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:19:59.0105783Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:19:59.0106358Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:19:59.0107207Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:19:59.0108160Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
